{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Cookie Match: Enhanced Edition  is now released on Google Play!</h2><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2268310/extras/google-play-badge.png?t=1700381943\" /><br><br><br>Cookie Match is a game that everyone can enjoy.<br>To match cookies and cookie cutters or icings, you will face different tricks in each room, that gives you a unique experience and entertainment. <br>Clear all the stages and reveal cookies' true stories!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">How to play</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Move cookies to place them in the matching cookie cutters or the matching cookie icings. <br></li><li>All the cookies move in the same direction as a set. <br></li><li>Once a cookie meets the matching cutter or the matching cookie icing, the decoration is completed.</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Caution</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Butter packs are unmovable, like a wall.<br></li><li>If a cookie hits the cutlery or a pigeon, then the cookie is fallen apart.</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Controls</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Control the direction with arrow keys or WASD (up / left / down / right) or touch / swipe<br></li><li>R for the stage reset<br></li><li>F for fullscreen on / off<br></li><li>ESC for the previous page <br></li><li>Backspace or Delete key for undo<br></li><li>M for music on / off</li></ul><br>* Background music from Epidemic Sound","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Gingerbread Cookie","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2268310/08b37d5a080d4bf3f0ed6ea021e101bca352e9cb.jpg"},{"name":" Christmas Tree Cookie","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2268310/ea0f7b81f697a0a652c6d5f04777f73d0389d705.jpg"},{"name":" Chocolate chip Cookie","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2268310/152077a74dd7ad0fdc5147214a09157a7957fd1f.jpg"},{"name":" Star Cookie